## System Monitoring Tools

### CPU & Memory

\`\`\`bash
# Real-time
top
htop

# Snapshot
ps aux --sort=-%cpu | head -10
ps aux --sort=-%mem | head -10

# Memory
free -h
vmstat 1 5

# CPU info
lscpu
cat /proc/cpuinfo
\`\`\`

### Disk I/O

\`\`\`bash
# iostat
iostat -x 1 5

# iotop (requires package)
iotop

# Disk usage
df -h
du -sh /var/*
\`\`\`

### Network

\`\`\`bash
# Connections
ss -tuln
netstat -tuln

# Traffic
iftop
nethogs

# Bandwidth test
iperf3 -s        # server
iperf3 -c IP     # client
\`\`\`

### System Info

\`\`\`bash
uptime
uname -a
hostnamectl
timedatectl
\`\`\`
